  "ingredients": [
    "1 pound ground beef",
    "1 (8 ounce) package egg noodles",
    "1 (10.5 ounce) can fat-free condensed cream of mushroom soup",
    "1 tablespoon garlic powder",
    "0.5 cup sour cream",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OwxNBcC17Eo6pgXb15ErzfNcv9c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16331-Simple_beef_Stroganoff-DDMFS-Step1-45f05953c4d94e999485c81329b8bfd7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16311/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sauté ground beef in a large skillet over medium heat until browned and crumbly; 5 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VQJNN7t1Qn_QL39L8O6T17aGAmE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16311-simple-beef-stroganoff-step-2-17894-accb6ee5e4f44855a4b0bf7874e16553.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16311/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, fill a large pot with lightly salted water and bring to a rapid boil. Cook egg noodles at a boil until tender yet firm to the bite, 7 to 9 minutes. Drain and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nzDbAwqxujgKJOiRPgjDJfcH4gc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16331-Simple_Beef_Stroganoff-DDMFS-Step3-19587ff198c7477daaffa8be440bf68b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16311/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain and discard any fat from the cooked beef. Stir condensed soup and garlic powder into the beef. Simmer for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kRl0MopiuJb8TUSBn5QkWVkB9jU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16311-simple-beef-stroganoff-step-3-17898-f301fbabf2e24bc88530ff21c5adee8c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16311/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove beef from the heat. Add egg noodles and stir to combine. Stir in sour cream and season with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3omsyRIjinAhIB16D8g5IK0cwQA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16311-simple-beef-stroganoff-step-5-178103-4x3-706da460ccc8443fbd561f5c5dfa02e4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16311/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Rh2NialypvMY-ory6lY4_6cFPvE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16311-simple-beef-stroganoff-DDMFS-4x3-1e966286eef54c0f96c882e569926eb3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16311/step_06.webp"
    }
